"beginWay":"TALK_BEGIN_MANUAL","heroTalk":"TALK_HERO_LOCAL","id":7012301,"initDialog":701230101,"nextRandomTalks":[],"nextTalks":[],"npcId":[1668],"performCfg":"","priority":2,"questId":70123,"showRandomTalkCount":0},"dialogs":[{"nodeId":701230101,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1668,"speakerName":"Joel","textMapHash":540704594,"text":"Where has Daddy gone...","nextNodeIds":[701230102]},{"nodeId":701230102,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":1668,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":2048919210,"text":"What's the matter?","nextNodeIds":[701230103]},{"nodeId":701230103,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1668,"speakerName":"Joel","textMapHash":3838351946,"text":"Ah, I... Hello... I—I can't find my daddy...","nextNodeIds":[701230104]},{"nodeId":701230104,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1668,"speakerName":"Joel","textMapHash":740111194,"text":"He said that he would come to pick me up and that we'd go see the snow together. But the time we arranged has come and gone, and he isn't here yet...","nextNodeIds":[701230105]},{"nodeId":701230105,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1668,"speakerName":"Joel","textMapHash":3759648154,"text":"I thought that he must have found some rare and precious treasure map or something, which is why he hasn't come to find me yet. That has to be it, right?","nextNodeIds":[701230106]},{"nodeId":701230106,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1668,"speakerName":"Joel","textMapHash":2439077594,"text":"So I came to Dragonspine by myself. If he's not going to come find me, then I'll go looking for him... Or so I thought...","nextNodeIds":[701230107]},{"nodeId":701230107,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1668,"speakerName":"Joel","textMapHash":4166681114,"text":"But I didn't find Daddy here, either. That Knight of Favonius over there said that he'd headed off for the mountain's summit...","nextNodeIds":[701230108]},{"nodeId":701230108,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1668,"speakerName":"Joel","textMapHash":2887727834,"text":"I wanted to go search for him, but the Knight wouldn't let me. So I'm stuck here waiting for Daddy to come back.","nextNodeIds":[701230109]},{"nodeId":701230109,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1668,"speakerName":"Joel","textMapHash":50433146,"text":"But... but he hasn't come back at all, and I'm worried.","nextNodeIds":[701230110]},{"nodeId":701230110,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1668,"speakerName":"Joel","textMapHash":1923003642,"text":"If you're going up Dragonspine, could you help me look for Daddy?","nextNodeIds":[701230111,701230112]},{"nodeId":701230111,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":335718818,"text":"Leave it to me, kiddo.","nextNodeIds":[701230113]},{"nodeId":701230113,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1668,"speakerName":"Joel","textMapHash":3959256850,"text":"You'll do it? Great!","nextNodeIds":[701230114]},{"nodeId":701230114,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1668,"speakerName":"Joel","textMapHash":1074083242,"text":"Let me think... That Knight said that Daddy did mention going to follow the <color=#00E1FFFF>Snow-Covered Path upwards</color> first...","nextNodeIds":[701230115]},{"nodeId":701230115,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1668,"speakerName":"Joel","textMapHash":800694890,"text":"He then said that he'd head over to the <color=#00E1FFFF>Outskirts of the Entombed City</color> to have a look, before trying for the <color=#00E1FFFF>mountain's summit</color>...","nextNodeIds":[701230116]},{"nodeId":701230116,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1668,"speakerName":"Joel","textMapHash":3348507178,"text":"Please help me to search these areas. Daddy might still be near one of them.","nextNodeIds":[701230117]},{"nodeId":701230117,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1668,"speakerName":"Joel","textMapHash":1024701106,"text":"I mean, he promised that we'd go see the snow together. There's no way that he'd break his promise...","nextNodeIds":[]},{"nodeId":701230112,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":75865394,"text":"Where should I look?","nextNodeIds":[701230113]}]},{"talkId":7012302,"talkConfig":{"checkActionAfter":false,"crowdLOD0List":[],"decoratorID":0,"disableTalkReview":false,"dontBlockDaily":false,"enableCameraDisplacement":false,"extraLoadMarkId":[],"finishExec":[{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"TALK_EXEC_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"TALK_EXEC_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"TALK_EXEC_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"TALK_EXEC_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"TALK_EXEC_NONE"}],"forceNpcNotDestroy":false,"heroRuleId":0,"ignoreDragonTalkRule":false,"isEnableNoBlackInter":false,"linkBehaviorGrpId":0,"loadType":"TALK_NORMAL_QUEST","lockGameTime":true,"lowPriority":false,"newTalkFinishTime":false,"onlyQuestNpc":false,"participantId":[],"prePerformCfg":"","questIdleTalk":false,"randomTalkPos":0,"randomTalkPriorityList":[],"removeDuplicatedRandomTalk":false,"stayFreeStyle":false,"talkMarkHideList":[],"talkMarkType":"TALK_MARK_NONE","activeMode":"PLAY_MODE_ALL","beginCond":[{"param":["7012301","3","","",""],"type":"QUEST_COND_STATE_EQUAL"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"QUEST_COND_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"QUEST_COND_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"QUEST_COND_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"QUEST_COND_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"QUEST_COND_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"QUEST_COND_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"QUEST_COND_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"QUEST_COND_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"QUEST_COND_NONE"}],"beginCondComb":"LOGIC_NONE","beginWay":"TALK_BEGIN_MANUAL","heroTalk":"TALK_HERO_LOCAL","id":7012302,"initDialog":701230201,"nextRandomTalks":[],"nextTalks":[],"npcId":[20181],"performCfg":"","priority":0,"questId":70123,"showRandomTalkCount":0},"dialogs":[{"nodeId":701230201,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20181,"speakerName":"Neatly-Written Note","textMapHash":3622575546,"text":"So far, so smooth. The weather is fine, supplies are plentiful, and the monsters have been on their best behavior...","nextNodeIds":[701230202]},{"nodeId":701230202,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20181,"speakerName":"Neatly-Written Note","textMapHash":371294618,"text":"I also discovered a copy of Volume 6 of \"The Boar Princess\" in my backpack. Joel must've sneaked it in there. That cheeky kid...","nextNodeIds":[701230203]},{"nodeId":701230203,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20181,"speakerName":"Neatly-Written Note","textMapHash":1296515258,"text":"Still, this book is about a brave Boar Princess and her journey up a snowy mountain with her companions... Well, I'm heading up a snowy mountain myself, and considering how well everything's gone so far... Who knows? Maybe this book is bringing me good luck. Thank you, Joel.","nextNodeIds":[701230204]},{"nodeId":701230204,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20181,"speakerName":"Neatly-Written Note","textMapHash":393227770,"text":"Anyway, I shall be heading off to the next campsite to resupply and record my progress, and then I'll head down the mountain. Joel is waiting for me, after all.","nextNodeIds":[]}]},{"talkId":7012306,"talkConfig":{"checkActionAfter":false,"crowdLOD0List":[],"decoratorID":0,"disableTalkReview":false,"dontBlockDaily":false,"enableCameraDisplacement":false,"extraLoadMarkId":[],"finishExec":[{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"TALK_EXEC_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"TALK_EXEC_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"TALK_EXEC_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"TALK_EXEC_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"TALK_EXEC_NONE"}],"forceNpcNotDestroy":false,"heroRuleId":0,"ignoreDragonTalkRule":false,"isEnableNoBlackInter":false,"linkBehaviorGrpId":0,"loadType":"TALK_NORMAL_QUEST","lockGameTime":false,"lowPriority":false,"newTalkFinishTime":false,"onlyQuestNpc":false,"participantId":[],"prePerformCfg":"","questIdleT